  "label": "#ProofOfPitch",
  "content": "\ud83d\udea8 Proof of Pitch Finalists Announced \ud83d\udea8\n\nOver 400 startups applied. 17 bold projects made the cut. Now, they will prepare to pitch at the Louvre.\n\nOn June 10\u201311, during Proof of Talk, the most visionary founders in DePIN, DeFi & Tokenization, Decentralized AI, and Bittensor subnets will take the stage for Proof of Pitch, judged by leading investors from @HaunVentures, @dragonfly_xyz, @TheSpartanGroup, and 13 more top-tier firms/investors.\n\nMeet the finalists:\n\nDePIN & Infra\n\u27a1\ufe0fCombinder \u2013 @combinderio \n\u27a1\ufe0fRoam Network \u2013 @roam_network \n\u27a1\ufe0fNodeops \u2013 @NodeOpsHQ\n\u27a1\ufe0fCharge \u2013 @charge_xyz \n\nDeFi & Tokenization\n\u27a1\ufe0fFormless \u2013 @formless_xyz \n\u27a1\ufe0fEntravel \u2013 @entravelhotels \n\u27a1\ufe0fAccountable \u2013 @AccountableData \n\u27a1\ufe0fTorram \u2013 @Torram_xyz \n\nDecentralized AI\n\u27a1\ufe0fNewcoin \u2013 @newcoin_nco \n\u27a1\ufe0fScore \u2013 @webuildscore \n\u27a1\ufe0fAloha Protocol \u2013 @AlohaProtocol \n\u27a1\ufe0fLitheum \u2013 @LitheumOfficial \n\nBittensor Subnets\n\u27a1\ufe0fGenomes \u2013 @GenomesDAO \n\u27a1\ufe0fNRN \u2013 @NRNAgents \n\u27a1\ufe0fSynth \u2013 by @SynthdataCo\n\u27a1\ufe0fNewcoin (dual track) \u2013 @newcoin_nco\n\u27a1\ufe0fXtend - @XtendAI_\n\nEach of these teams will pitch live in front of a jury of world-class investors and ecosystem leaders.\n\nTo every founder who applied, thank you. The quality, ambition, and energy from this year\u2019s applicants were exceptional. You made this selection incredibly competitive, and your vision continues to inspire us.\n\nThis isn\u2019t a demo day.\nThis is the Louvre.\nThis is where the future gets decided.\n\nJoin us:Powered byHosted at Proof of Talk | June 10\u201311, Paris\n\n#ProofOfPitch #ProofOfTalk #Web3 #AI #DePIN",
