  "source": "X",
  "label": "#TAO",
  "content": "Bittensor Subnet 44 Validator Hotfix Update\n\nWe\u2019ve released a new validator update to improve stability and fairness across the network. If you're running a validator, make sure to update as soon as possible.\n\nHere\u2019s what\u2019s changing \ud83d\udd3d\n\n\u2705 Max Processing Time Capped at 15s\n- Slow hotkeys (e.g. 200s) were skewing speed score normalization\n- Any response >15s now gets a speed score of 0\n- Speed score normalization now uses the lesser of 15s or the observed max\n\n\u2705 Unresponsive Hotkeys Penalized\n- Previously, some hotkeys stayed active despite being unresponsive for up to 72h\n- Now, a timeout = empty response = score penalty\n\nThese changes improve the fairness of the scoring system and ensure that only responsive, efficient validators are rewarded. $TAO",
