2025-06-05 14:58:40,285 - DEBUG - Processing raw tweet: {
  "uri": "https://x.com/webuildscore/status/1922670217768980658",
  "datetime": "2025-05-14T15:07:56+00:00",
  "source": "X",
  "label": null,
  "content": "Score is expanding rapidly and we\u2019re happy to welcome Sam (@sirubi_eth) as our new Content Writer!\n\nWith a deep curiosity sparked by Bitcoin and the 2017 ICO boom, Sam has spent the past decade exploring how blockchain can reshape finance, data, and systems of power. He has worked across various Web3 projects, writing on everything from decentralised finance and money to interoperability and tokenised real-world assets. With a solid grasp of financial systems, macroeconomics, and their intersection with crypto, Sam has a knack for breaking down complex ideas and uncovering their broader societal implications, translating them into clear, accessible narratives for a broad audience.\n\nCombining deep Web3 expertise, sharp storytelling, and a lifelong passion for football, Sam is a natural fit to help shape Score\u2019s voice. He connected immediately with the mission to democratise elite sports data and now plays a key role in articulating Score\u2019s broader vision: building the decentralised computer vision layer for AI, starting with football and expanding far beyond the pitch.\n\nA word from Sam:\n \u201cI\u2019ve come to believe that decentralisation is key to increasing access, enabling scale, and democratising critical systems, whether it\u2019s money, finance, or intelligence. That\u2019s what drew me to Score. As a football fan, I\u2019ve seen how data is transforming the sport, yet access remains locked behind paywalls and elite infrastructure. Score changes that. By decentralising computer vision, it puts powerful tools in the hands of every club, making the game more open, competitive, and dynamic.\nBut the vision goes far beyond football. Score is building foundational infrastructure to unlock visual intelligence across sports, industries, and entirely new domains. I\u2019m proud to be part of a team that\u2019s not just building cutting-edge technology, but doing it in a way that empowers more people to participate, compete, and innovate.\u201d",
  "user": {
    "username": "webuildscore",
    "display_name": "Score",
    "id": "1816264150755979264",
    "verified": false,
    "followers_count": 4668,
    "following_count": 611
  },
