  "content": "Answer:\ud83d\udcb9 Proposed Same-Game Parlay\n\nBase Leg: Double Chance (Draw or Inter to Win)\n\nOdds: 1.87 (bet365)\nImplied Probability: 53.48%\nRationale: This introduces a safe market under your requested condition, leveraging the tight match probabilities (Draw: 23.53%, Inter Win: 28.64%) for a total of 52.17% modeled probability, comparing favorably to bookmaker evaluation.\n\nCorrelated Leg: Over 2.5 Goals\n\nOdds: 2.10 (10Bet)\nImplied Probability: 47.62%\nModel Probability: 60.66%\nExpected Value: +7.84% \u2705\nRationale: Goals are expected to flow in this high-tempo final, with Inter employing a counter-attacking style and PSG\u2019s offense pushing for a decisive result.\n\n\ud83d\udcca SGP Breakdown\n\nCombined Odds: Approximately 3.93\n\nStatistical Correlation: Matches with high goal expectations often involve an underdog\u2019s push for offensive results, supporting the Draw/Inter scenario while maintaining synergy with Over 2.5 Goals.\n\nRisk Control: Both legs are statistically well-aligned and avoid overlap risk.\n\n\ud83d\udccc Optional Third Leg (Increased Payout)\n\nLeg: Over 6 Corners\n\nOdds: 1.30 (Widely Available)\nImplied Probability: 76.92%\nModel Probability: 78.27%\nRationale: High-paced finals often result in multiple set pieces (corners). Adding this leg increases the parlay\u2019s payout while keeping risk moderate.\n\nRevised Combined Odds: 5.12",
