  "datetime": "2025-06-05T10:23:26+00:00",
  "source": "X",
  "label": null,
  "content": "Winning Metrics #04: xThreat\n\nNot every pass is equal. Some moves create chaos before the shot ever happens.\n\nWe break down xThreat (Expected Threat) - the stat that measures how teams create danger before the assist.\n\nLet\u2019s explore the art of progression \ud83d\udd3d\n1/9\ud83e\uddf5",
