  "content": "It\u2019s the stat that spots the pre-assisters and pattern disruptors:\n\n \u26a1\ufe0fDoku \u2013 elite dribble-driven xT\n \ud83c\udfafTAA \u2013 line-splitting passer\n \u2699\ufe0fRodri \u2013 the silent tempo-setter\n \ud83d\udd01\u00c1ngelino \u2013 overlap machine\n \ud83e\udde0De Bruyne \u2013 architect before the assist",
