  "source": "X",
  "label": null,
  "content": "\ud83d\udd0d How xT works:\n\nImagine the pitch as a probability heatmap.\nEach zone is assigned a goal likelihood.\n\nA pass from zone A to zone B adds xThreat if B is more dangerous than A.\n\n\u27a1\ufe0f 0.01 to 0.07? That move added 0.06 xT.",
  "user": {
    "username": "webuildscore",
    "display_name": "Score",
