  "source": "X",
  "label": null,
  "content": "xG tells you who finishes.\nxA tells you who assists.\nBut xThreat?\n\nIt tells you who moves the game forward - before the final pass is even made.\n\nIt\u2019s how a dribble, carry, or vertical pass shifts the pitch in your favour.",
