2025-06-12 12:36:25,154 - DEBUG - Processing raw tweet: {
  "uri": "https://x.com/thedkingdao/status/1931356088839909550",
  "datetime": "2025-06-07T14:22:29+00:00",
  "source": "X",
  "label": null,
  "content": "Kelly implementation exemplified:\n\nSay there\u2019s a bet with a 2.00 odd, but we\u2019ve found a 25% +EV edge (we think there\u2019s a higher probability than the bookies are assigning to an outcome)\n\nThe formula would look like this:\nb = net odds = 2.00 \u2212 1 = 1\np = true win probability = 0.625\n1 \u2212 p = lose probability = 0.375\nf* = (1 \u00d7 0.625 \u2212 0.375) / 1\n= 0.25\n\nThis means that your optimal bankroll allocation for this bet is calculated as 25%.",
  "user": {
    "username": "thedkingdao",
    "display_name": "DKING",
    "id": "1882543910888632320",
    "verified": false,
    "followers_count": 2472,
    "following_count": 1
  },
  "tweet": {
