  "datetime": "2025-06-07T14:22:31Z",
  "content": "L;DR: Nail the stake, not just the pick.\n\n \u2022 Size every wager off an edge; Kelly shows the math\n \u2022 Shave it to 10-50 % Kelly for a lower risk, smoother ride\n \u2022 Compound edges, survive bad runs, let bankroll snowball \ud83d\udcc8\n\nBankroll &gt; hot takes. Bet smart, stay solvent. \u267b\ufe0f",
  "username": "thedkingdao",
  "display_name": "DKING",
  "user_id": "1882543910888632320",
  "verified": false,
  "followers_count": 2472,
  "following_count": 1,
  "like_count": 3,
  "retweet_count": 0,
  "reply_count": 0,
  "quote_count": 0,
  "is_retweet": false,
  "is_reply": true,
  "is_quote": false,
  "conversation_id": "1931356071894925671",
  "in_reply_to_user_id": "1882543910888632320",
  "in_reply_to_username": null,
  "processed_at": "2025-06-12T07:06:25Z"
}
2025-06-12 12:36:25,160 - DEBUG - Processed tweet 1931356099153998239
2025-06-12 12:36:25,160 - DEBUG - Processing raw tweet: {
  "uri": "https://x.com/thedkingdao/status/1931356090974760973",
  "datetime": "2025-06-07T14:22:29+00:00",
  "source": "X",
  "label": null,
  "content": "Fractional kelly implementation\n\nUsing the same example, a fractional kelly of 10% would allocate 2.5% of total bankroll.\n\nYou can see how a fully kelly implementation invites a lot of risk. Lose 3 bets in a row where you allocate 25% of bankroll? You are down over half of your bankroll just from 3 bets.",
