2025-06-12 12:36:25,166 - DEBUG - Processing raw tweet: {
  "uri": "https://x.com/thedkingdao/status/1931356095056130142",
  "datetime": "2025-06-07T14:22:30+00:00",
  "source": "X",
  "label": null,
  "content": "Kelly only works if your edge is real.\n\nIn sports betting, your probability estimates are never perfect. Small errors can lead to oversizing and big losses.\n\nFractional Kelly helps manage that uncertainty. Bet smart. Compound consistently in a risk-adjusted manner.",
