  "content": "Full kelly risk\n\nWhile full Kelly aims to maximise growth, it still introduces notable risk, as:\n\n\u2022 Volatility is enormous\n \u2022 A few mis-priced edges = ugly drawdowns\n \u2022 No buffer for model error",
