  "content": "Scaling with Precision: Introducing\u202fBas\u202fKottier \u2014 Score\u2019s Chief Financial\u202fOfficer\n\nWe\u2019re excited to formally introduce Bas Kottier, Score\u2019s Chief Financial Officer. With three months already under his belt as CFO, he has been instrumental in laying the groundwork for Score\u2019s next stage of growth, ensuring we scale sustainably with clarity and long-term vision.\n\nBas joins us with a formidable track record. After graduating cum laude with a Master\u2019s in Finance, he spent seven years refining his skills in the demanding real estate sector, working as a controller and eventually rising to the position of Head of Finance. There, he mastered the art of building robust financial systems that balanced strategic foresight with rigorous oversight.\n\nBut while Bas built a successful career in traditional finance, he was living a parallel life at the intersection of sports, betting, and Web3. As a crypto investor since 2017 and a seasoned sports bettor for over a decade, Bas developed a foundational understanding of risk, value, and emerging trends years before they went mainstream.\n\nThat convergence closely aligns with Score\u2019s identity, where decentralised AI meets real-time sports intelligence, and Bas\u2019s rare mix of discipline and domain fluency helps us navigate this frontier with confidence.\n\nA word from Bas:\n\n\u201cI\u2019ve always wanted to work in an industry that aligns with my personal passions; sports, sports betting, and Web3. For years, I followed these spaces closely in my own time, while building a career in finance. Joining Score feels like a natural fit: it\u2019s where my professional background and personal interests meet. I\u2019m excited to help build a sustainable and scalable future for a company that\u2019s reshaping how the world sees and understands sports.\u201d\n\nBas\u2019s journey captures the mix of passion and precision we prize at Score. Disruption demands more than vision; it requires disciplined execution at scale. As CFO, Bas supplies that discipline, laying the financial foundation that enables our team to move fast and innovate with confidence. His focus on long-term health and scalable growth powers our march to redefine sports intelligence and build the Optic Nerve of AI.",
