2025-08-04 20:22:45,703 - DEBUG - Processing raw tweet: {
  "uri": "https://x.com/webuildscore/status/1942893111862276157",
  "datetime": "2025-07-09T10:26:29+00:00",
  "source": "X",
  "label": null,
  "content": "In a tournament this diverse, trophies won't go to the flashiest squad. \ud83c\udfc6\n\nThey'll go to the club that learns fastest\u2014reading styles, adapting tempo, and seizing the five-second windows where games flip.\n\nFull breakdown:",
